{
  "_meta": {
    "description": "Phase 4D Agent evaluation set: tool selection, argument correctness, clarification and grounding of the n8n AI Agent over the Consultant tools. Separate from the unchanged Phase 3D retrieval_cases.json and the Phase 4B gold plans.",
    "version": "agent-cases-v1",
    "authoring_rules": [
      "Expectations encode only what the user text states (tool by operation; arguments by stated constraints). They were written before any live Agent run and are not tuned to Agent output.",
      "args: the subset that must be present with exactly these values (lists compared as sets). acceptable_args: alternative subsets that count as acceptable but not exact. forbidden_args: keys that must not be sent (e.g. an invented budget).",
      "tool=null means no catalog tool should be called. acceptable_tools lists other tools that are a defensible first choice.",
      "clarification: required | forbidden | optional (whether the final answer should ask the user a question).",
      "grounding.must_mention_any: each inner list is a set of alternatives; at least one must occur in the answer (case-insensitive). grounding.forbidden_patterns: regexes that must not match. grounding.manual_review: aspects a reviewer must judge by reading.",
      "offline: assertions on the tool result when the expected call is executed against the catalog. Product truths come from the committed Phase 3D dataset (retrieval_cases.json), never from Consultant output.",
      "The follow-up family is an exploratory Phase 4F spike; it is reported separately and excluded from the headline metrics.",
      "Gate 4D.2D label corrections (from recorded 4D.2C reviewer verdicts, not from new Agent output): get-tv-unknown-model accepts 'нет модели'; stats-cheapest-oled accepts category OLED (the same product set as panel_technology OLED in this catalog)."
    ]
  },
  "cases": [
